=== Recipe ===
The recipe may be obtained from the Illuminated Boreal Weapons collection, as one of the rewards for progress towards it. The achievement for crafting all 16 Illuminated weapons has 9 tiers of rewards associated with it with the Eitrite Ingot recipe being one of them.
