== Trivia ==
* [[w:Eitr|Eitr]] is a mythical substance in Norse Mythology. Paradoxically, it was both the origin of life and also incredibly poisonous. It was also produced in part by [[w:Jörmungandr|Jörmungandr]], after whom [[Jormag]] is likely named.
